# idDAS Topology Mock Client

Vanilla JavaScript client-side replacement for `/cgi/cmd.lua`. Reference screen: **Topology** (`src/msdh/index.html`).

## Naming conventions

| Context | Convention | Example |
|---------|------------|---------|
| DOM `id` (legacy parity) | snake_case | `#topology-container`, `#system_overview` |
| CSS classes (new mock) | BEM block__element--modifier | `.topology-layer__header` |
| JS variables / functions | camelCase | `layerModel`, `computeLayerSeverity` |
| JS constants / enums | SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE | `TOPOLOGY_LAYER_LABELS`, `FIXTURE_META` |
| Mock API commands | exact axsh string (preserve spaces) | `operators --json` |
| JSON fields from backend | preserve axsh casing/spaces | `"Node Type"`, `"SectorID"` |
| File names | kebab-case or camelCase by type | `fixtureSnapshot.js`, `system-overview.css` |
| Data-bind hooks | `data-bind="camelCase"` | `data-bind="activeRoutingProfile"` |
| Component roots | `data-component="kebab-case"` | `data-component="topology-canvas"` |

