## Layout tokens (from production CSS/JS)

- Header height: `50px`; title left offset: `495px`, top: `11px`
- Topology vertical offset: `98px` (header + system overview)
- Layer header height: `30px`; fill: `rgba(137,150,160,0.5)`
- Layer title x: `30px`; layer LED: circle r=`7`, cx=`98%`
- Node sizes: SECTGRP `30×30`, APOI `100×27`, MTDI `100×10` (render ×6), MSDH `100×9` (render ×6)
- Font: Verdana 12px; brand blue `#00A4F2`

## Status model

Node fields: `Comm` (`0`=connected, `1`=comm fail, `-`=unknown), `Status` (`0`=red … `4`=green).

Layer LED = worst severity across child nodes (see `computeLayerSeverity` in `fixtureSnapshot.js`).

## Mock API contract

Implement commands exactly as production polls them:

- `username`, `get tag`, `get mdl`, `get swv`, `operators --json`, `bands --json`
- `SECTGRP -o {op} list --sectors && sector -o {op} --json`
- `zone -o {op} list --nodes && topology -o {op} --json && rack topology --json`
- `rfroute -o {op} --json`

Register new commands in `MockAxshApi.registerCommand()`. Use `fixtureSnapshot.js` for screenshot-accurate data.

## Implementation rules

- No jQuery, RequireJS, or D3 in mock-client — pure DOM + CSS Grid/Flexbox
- Reuse assets from `src/images/` via relative paths
- Keep mock latency configurable (`MockAxshApi({ latencyMs })`)
- Rack View toggle logs stub until rack renderer is ported from `msdh/code.js drawARack()`

